## Troubleshooting

### Plugin Not Loading
- Check `mainClass` matches the actual class name
- Verify `plugin.json` is in the JAR root
- Ensure all required fields are present

### Permission Denied
- Add required permissions to `plugin.json`
- Check permission ID spelling

